  "Collects the 52 issues. While we don’t recommend skipping issues, Renée Montoya’s story takes mostly places in #1-2, #4-5, #7, #9, #11-12, #16, #18, #23, #26-28, #30, 33-34, 36, 52 (Kate Kane doesn’t appear in everything here, but it’s better for context).": "Reúne as 52 edições. A fonte recomenda a leitura integral. A história de Renée Montoya se concentra em #1-2, #4-5, #7, #9, #11-12, #16, #18, #23, #26-28, #30, 33-34, 36 e 52. Kate Kane não aparece em todas elas, mas a leitura ajuda a entender o contexto.",
  "Collects Crime Bible: The Five Lessons Of Blood #1-5. Spinning out from the events of 52 is this limited series featuring Renée Montoya as the Question. While Kate Kane only appears in #3, the story focused on The Religion of Crime, an important secret organization in Kate Kane’s story.": "Reúne Crime Bible: The Five Lessons Of Blood #1-5. Esta minissérie deriva dos acontecimentos de 52 e apresenta Renée Montoya como Question. Kate Kane só aparece na edição #3, mas a trama se concentra na Religion of Crime, organização secreta importante em sua história.",
