  "new Collects Batman (2016) #137-138, Catwoman (2018) #57-58, Batman/Catwoman: The Gotham War: Battle Lines #1, Batman/Catwoman: The Gotham War: Scorched Earth #1, And Batman/Catwoman: The Gotham War: Red Hood #1-2.": "Reúne Batman (2016) #137-138, Catwoman (2018) #57-58, Batman/Catwoman: The Gotham War: Battle Lines #1, Batman/Catwoman: The Gotham War: Scorched Earth #1, e Batman/Catwoman: The Gotham War: Red Hood #1-2.",
  "new Collects The Joker: The Man Who Stopped Laughing #7-12. This volume spins out from Knight Terrors through to after Gotham War.": "Reúne The Joker: The Man Who Stopped Laughing #7-12. Este volume começa nos desdobramentos de Knight Terrors e avança até depois de Gotham War.",
  "new Part of the Beast World Event. Red Hood is the main character for the Scavengers story, collected in Titans: Beast World Tour.": "Parte do evento Beast World. Red Hood protagoniza “Scavengers”, reunida em Titans: Beast World Tour.",
  "new Collects Batman (vol. 3) #145-152. Jason appears in issues #145 and #148. This story concludes the Zur-En-Arrh’s story from Chip Zdarksy’s run.": "Reúne Batman (vol. 3) #145-152. Jason aparece nas edições #145 e #148. Esta história encerra o arco de Zur-En-Arrh na fase de Chip Zdarsky.",
  "new Collected in Batman and Robin Vol. 1: Memento, Part One": "Reunida em Batman and Robin Vol. 1: Memento, Part One",
