  "Collected in Convergence: Flashpoint Book 2. With Pre-Flashpoint Jason.": "Reunida em Convergence: Flashpoint Book 2, com o Jason de antes de Flashpoint.",
  "(Black Label) Collects Batman: Three Jokers #1-3. Now available in an Absolute Edition.": "(Black Label.) Reúne Batman: Three Jokers #1-3. Também disponível em Absolute Edition.",
  "(Black Label) Collects Suicide Squad: Get Joker #1-3.": "(Black Label) Reúne Suicide Squad: Get Joker #1-3.",
  "Collects Titans United #1-7. Titans United is a non-canonical Titans story in the DC Universe that uses the lineup of the HBO Max’s Titans series.": "Reúne Titans United #1-7. Titans United é uma história fora da continuidade principal do universo DC, com a formação da série de TV Titans, da HBO Max.",
  "new What if one of the darkest hours in Batman’s crime-fighting career never happened? Collects the entire four-issue miniseries along with Batman #426, #427, and #429 and the faux-simile issue Batman #428: Robin Lives! that lead up to this momentous elseworld.": "E se um dos momentos mais sombrios da carreira de Batman nunca tivesse acontecido? Reúne a minissérie completa de quatro edições, além de Batman #426, #427 e #429 e da edição alternativa Batman #428: Robin Lives!, que preparam esta história de universo alternativo.",
  "This sequel to The Long Halloween from Jeph Loeb and Tim Sale is set three to four years into Batman’s career as a crime fighter. It’s a Batman story that also doubles as the post-crisis origin story for Robin. I personally think Dick is not well explored in that story but there’s not a lot of good alternatives for this specific period in Dick’s life. Don’t forget, this story is not part of the canon post-Infinite Frontier era.": "Continuação de The Long Halloween, por Jeph Loeb e Tim Sale, situada entre o terceiro e o quarto ano da carreira de Batman. Também funciona como a origem de Robin no período pós-Crisis. A fonte considera Dick pouco explorado, mas observa que há poucas alternativas para essa etapa de sua vida. Segundo a fonte, esta história não integra a continuidade da era pós-Infinite Frontier.",
  "Written by Chuck Dixon and Scott Beatty and illustrated by Javier Pulido and Marcos Martin, this classic comic tells of Dick Grayson’s first year as Batman’s sidekick, Robin.": "Com roteiro de Chuck Dixon e Scott Beatty e arte de Javier Pulido e Marcos Martin, este clássico conta o primeiro ano de Dick Grayson como Robin, parceiro de Batman.",
  "A light miniseries that retraces the early days of the Teen Titans, by Amy Wolfram and Karl Kerschl. Or you can simply read The Wolfman and Pérez run of the 80’s!": "Minissérie leve que revisita os primeiros dias dos Teen Titans, por Amy Wolfram e Karl Kerschl. Outra opção é ler a fase de Wolfman e Pérez dos anos 1980.",
  "Mark Waid and Chris Samnee recently explored the earliest years of Batman and Robin in this 12-issue limited series.": "Mark Waid e Chris Samnee exploram os primeiros anos de Batman e Robin nesta minissérie de 12 edições.",
  "A modern retelling of the early adventures of the original Teen Titans! This is a spin-off to Batman/Superman: World’s Finest, a modern take on the early team-ups between Batman and Superman, also featuring Robin (issue #6 is focused on the Boy Wonder).": "Releitura moderna das primeiras aventuras dos Teen Titans originais. Deriva de Batman/Superman: World’s Finest, que revisita as primeiras parcerias entre Batman e Superman e também traz Robin; a edição #6 se concentra nele.",
  "Collects Tales of the Teen Titans #41–58, Annual #3, The New Teen Titans (vol. 2) #1–9": "Reúne Tales of the Teen Titans #41–58, Annual #3, The New Teen Titans (vol. 2) #1–9",
  "Collects The New Teen Titans (vol. 2) #10–31, Annual #1–2, Omega Men #3": "Reúne The New Teen Titans (vol. 2) #10–31, Annual #1–2, Omega Men #3",
  "Collects The New Teen Titans (vol. 2) #32–49, Annual #3–4, Infinity, Inc. #45, Secret Origins #13, Annual #3, Tales of the New Teen Titans #91.": "Reúne The New Teen Titans (vol. 2) #32–49, Annual #3–4, Infinity, Inc. #45, Secret Origins #13, Annual #3, Tales of the New Teen Titans #91.",
  "Collects Secret Origins #13 and Action Comics Weekly #613-618 and 627-634.": "Reúne Secret Origins #13 e Action Comics Weekly #613-618 e 627-634.",
  "Collects The New Teen Titans (1980) #38, Tales of the Teen Titans (1984) #50, The New Titans (1988) #50-55, Teen Titans/Outsiders Secret Files 2003 (2003) #1.": "Reúne The New Teen Titans (1980) #38, Tales of the Teen Titans (1984) #50, The New Titans (1988) #50-55, Teen Titans/Outsiders Secret Files 2003 (2003) #1.",
  "Collects Deathstroke, the Terminator (1991) #14-16, The New Titans (1988) #90-92, and Team Titans (1992) #1-3.": "Reúne Deathstroke, the Terminator (1991) #14-16, The New Titans (1988) #90-92, e Team Titans (1992) #1-3.",
  "Collects Batman #509-510 & #512-515, Batman: Shadow Of The Bat #29-30 & #32-35, Detective Comics #676-677 & #679-682, Robin #8-9 & #11-14, Catwoman #12-13, Batman: Legends Of The Dark Knight #62-63, Showcase ’94 #10, Nightwing: Alfred’s Return #1, Batman: Vengeance Of Bane #2.": "Reúne Batman #509-510 & #512-515, Batman: Shadow Of The Bat #29-30 & #32-35, Detective Comics #676-677 & #679-682, Robin #8-9 & #11-14, Catwoman #12-13, Batman: Legends Of The Dark Knight #62-63, Showcase ’94 #10, Nightwing: Alfred’s Return #1, Batman: Vengeance Of Bane #2.",
  "Collects Nightwing (vol. 1) #1-4; Nightwing (vol. 2) #1-25, #1,000,000; Nightwing Annual #1; Wizard Presents: Nightwing #1/2; Nightwing and Huntress #1-4; Green Arrow (vol. 2) #134-135; Robin (vol. 2) #55; and Detective Comics #723-725 and #1,000,000.": "Reúne Nightwing (vol. 1) #1-4; Nightwing (vol. 2) #1-25, #1,000,000; Nightwing Annual #1; Wizard Presents: Nightwing #1/2; Nightwing and Huntress #1-4; Green Arrow (vol. 2) #134-135; Robin (vol. 2) #55; e Detective Comics #723-725 e #1,000,000.",
  "[2025] Collects Nightwing #26-59; Nightwing 80-Page Giant #1; Nightwing: Secret Files & Origins #1; Action Comics #771; Batman Annual #23; Birds of Prey #8, #20-21; and stories from Batman Chronicles #20 and DCU Holiday Bash II #1.": "[2025] Reúne Nightwing #26-59; Nightwing 80-Page Giant #1; Nightwing: Secret Files & Origins #1; Action Comics #771; Batman Annual #23; Birds of Prey #8, #20-21; e histórias de Batman Chronicles #20 e DCU Holiday Bash II #1.",
  "[2026] Collects Batman #600 and #605; Nightwing #60-82; The Flash Plus Nightwing #1; Birds of Prey #37; Batman: Gotham Knights #14, #16-17, and #20-21; Nightwing: The Target #1; Batman: The 10-Cent Adventure #1; Joker: Last Laugh Secret Files and Origins #1; Joker: Last Laugh #1-6; and Nightwing: Our Worlds at War #1.": "[2026] Reúne Batman #600 e #605; Nightwing #60-82; The Flash Plus Nightwing #1; Birds of Prey #37; Batman: Gotham Knights #14, #16-17, e #20-21; Nightwing: The Target #1; Batman: The 10-Cent Adventure #1; Joker: Last Laugh Secret Files and Origins #1; Joker: Last Laugh #1-6; e Nightwing: Our Worlds at War #1.",
