  "Peter Parker: The Spectacular Spider-Man Vol. 3: Amazing Fantasy Collects Peter Parker: The Spectacular Spider-Man (2017) #301-303 and Annual #1. Don’t read Annual #1 here, see after Amazing Spider-Man: Worldwide Vol. 9": "Peter Parker: The Spectacular Spider-Man Vol. 3: Amazing Fantasy — Reúne Peter Parker: The Spectacular Spider-Man (2017) #301-303 e Annual #1. Não leia Annual #1 neste ponto; deixe para depois de Amazing Spider-Man: Worldwide Vol. 9.",
  "Peter Parker: The Spectacular Spider-Man Vol. 4: Coming Home Collects Peter Parker: The Spectacular Spider-Man (2017) #304-310. Stop after #307, which concludes the arc. The last issue takes place later.": "Peter Parker: The Spectacular Spider-Man Vol. 4: Coming Home — Reúne Peter Parker: The Spectacular Spider-Man (2017) #304-310. Pare após #307, que conclui o arco. A última edição se passa mais adiante.",
  "Azrael Vol. 1: Fallen Angel Collects Batman: Sword Of Azrael #1-4, Showcase ’94 #10, And Azrael #1-7. For now, read only the Batman: Sword Of Azrael miniseries.": "Azrael Vol. 1: Fallen Angel — Reúne Batman: Sword Of Azrael #1-4, Showcase ’94 #10, e Azrael #1-7. Por enquanto, leia apenas a minissérie Batman: Sword Of Azrael.",
  "Azrael Vol. 1: Fallen Angel Collects Batman: Sword Of Azrael #1-4, Showcase ’94 #10, And Azrael #1-7. This time, read Showcase ’94 #10 (if you skipped Knightfall) and Azrael #1-7.": "Azrael Vol. 1: Fallen Angel — Reúne Batman: Sword Of Azrael #1-4, Showcase ’94 #10, e Azrael #1-7. Desta vez, leia Showcase ’94 #10 (se você pulou Knightfall) e Azrael #1-7.",
  "Batman: Road to No Man’s Land Vol. 2 Collects Detective Comics #727-729, Batman #560-562, Batman: Shadow Of The Bat #80-82, The Batman Chronicles #15, Azrael #47-50, Batman: No Man’s Land Secret Files And Origins #1.": "Batman: Road to No Man’s Land Vol. 2 — Reúne Detective Comics #727-729, Batman #560-562, Batman: Shadow Of The Bat #80-82, The Batman Chronicles #15, Azrael #47-50, Batman: No Man’s Land Secret Files And Origins #1.",
