  "Batman/Wildcat Collects Batman/Wildcat #1-3, The Brave and the Bold (1955) #88, 97, 110, 118, & 127, and Catwoman/Wildcat #1-4. (Set after Catwoman vol. 2 #60)": "Batman/Wildcat — Reúne Batman/Wildcat #1-3, The Brave and the Bold (1955) #88, 97, 110, 118, & 127, e Catwoman/Wildcat #1-4. (Situada depois de Catwoman vol. 2 #60.)",
