  "Ed Brubaker used Selina Kyle in a two-part story in Gotham Central, “On the Freak Beat” (Gotham Central #26-27), collected in the Gotham Central Omnibus.": "Ed Brubaker incluiu Selina Kyle no arco de duas partes “On the Freak Beat”, em Gotham Central #26-27, reunido em Gotham Central Omnibus.",
  "Catwoman #13-17 are part of the Year of the Villains story, got here for more information.": "Catwoman #13-17 fazem parte de Year of the Villains; consulte a ordem de leitura do evento para mais informações.",
  "Batman: Batman and Son Collects Batman #655-658, #663-669 et #672-675. Recently reprinted in Batman by Grant Morrison Book One": "Batman: Batman and Son — Reúne Batman #655-658, #663-669 et #672-675. Reimpressa em Batman by Grant Morrison Book One",
  "You need to stop reading this volume after #669 to pick up the crossover story The Resurrection of Ra’s Al Ghul.": "Pare a leitura deste volume após #669 para acompanhar o crossover The Resurrection of Ra’s Al Ghul.",
  "Once this crossover is concluded, you can finish reading Batman and Son.": "Depois de concluir esse crossover, retome e termine Batman and Son.",
  "Batman #672-683 are tie-in to Final Crisis": "Batman #672-683 se conectam a Final Crisis.",
  "Batman and Robin vol. 2 #9 is a tie-in to Batman: Night of the Owls, a comic book crossover event written by Scott Snyder. It is a follow-up to Batman: Gates of Gotham, and takes place during The Court of Owls.": "Batman and Robin vol. 2 #9 se conecta a Batman: Night of the Owls, crossover escrito por Scott Snyder. É uma continuação de Batman: Gates of Gotham e se passa durante The Court of Owls.",
  "Batman and Robin #15-16 are tie-ins to Batman: Death of the Family.": "Batman and Robin #15-16 se conectam a Batman: Death of the Family.",
  "Damian does not appear in Batman and Robin Vol. 5: The Big Burn. Tomasi gave us a Two-Face story instead.": "Damian não aparece em Batman and Robin Vol. 5: The Big Burn. Neste volume, Tomasi conta uma história de Two-Face.",
  "Robin #13-14 are part of Batman: Shadow War. For more information, see our reading order.": "Robin #13-14 fazem parte de Batman: Shadow War. Consulte a ordem de leitura para mais informações.",
  "Lazarus Planet Collects Lazarus Planet: Alpha, Lazarus Planet: Assault on Krypton, Lazarus Planet: We Once Were Gods, Lazarus Planet: Legends Reborn, Lazarus Planet: Next Evolution, Lazarus Planet: Dark Fate, and Lazarus Planet: Omega! To read between Issues #4 & 5 of Batman Vs. Robin": "Lazarus Planet — Reúne Lazarus Planet: Alpha, Lazarus Planet: Assault on Krypton, Lazarus Planet: We Once Were Gods, Lazarus Planet: Legends Reborn, Lazarus Planet: Next Evolution, Lazarus Planet: Dark Fate, e Lazarus Planet: Omega! Leia entre Batman Vs. Robin #4 e 5.",
  "Collects Batman / Santa Claus: Silent Knight #1-4.": "Reúne Batman / Santa Claus: Silent Knight #1-4.",
  "DC’s ‘Twas the Mite Before Christmas #1 new Damian appears in the “Wonderful Toys” story featuring Bat-Mite.": "DC’s ‘Twas the Mite Before Christmas #1 — Damian aparece em “Wonderful Toys”, com Bat-Mite.",
