  "Robin War (event) Collects Robin War #1-2, Robin: Son Of Batman #7, Grayson #15, Detective Comics #47, We Are Robin #7, Gotham Academy #13, Red Hood/Arsenal #7 and Teen Titans #15.": "Robin War (event) — Reúne Robin War #1-2, Robin: Son Of Batman #7, Grayson #15, Detective Comics #47, We Are Robin #7, Gotham Academy #13, Red Hood/Arsenal #7 e Teen Titans #15.",
  "Red Hood: Outlaw #49 is a tie-in to Batman: Joker War. Jason appears in a few issues of this event.": "Red Hood: Outlaw #49 se conecta a Batman: Joker War. Jason aparece em algumas edições do evento.",
  "Collects Red Hood #51-52 and Red Hood: The Hill #0-6. While Red Hood has been published later, it was supposed to be set before Death Metal. A few notes in the book tells us it’s set around here. We Suppose.": "Reúne Red Hood #51-52 e Red Hood: The Hill #0-6. Embora Red Hood tenha sido publicada depois, a trama deveria se passar antes de Death Metal. Algumas notas do volume sugerem esta posição na lista, mas a fonte apresenta isso como uma suposição.",
  "Batman: The Arkham Saga Omnibus Collects Batman: Arkham Asylum: The Road to Arkham, Batman: Arkham City #1-5, Batman: Arkham City: End Game #1, Batman: Arkham Knight #1-12, Batman: Arkham Knight Annual #1, Batman: Arkham Knight: Batgirl & Harley Quinn #1, Batman: Arkham Knight Genesis #1-6, Batman: Arkham Knight: Robin Special #1, Batman: Arkham Origins and Batman: Arkham Unhinged. Go check out our Arkham Knight reading order for the full experience (Comics and Games.)": "Batman: The Arkham Saga Omnibus — Reúne Batman: Arkham Asylum: The Road to Arkham, Batman: Arkham City #1-5, Batman: Arkham City: End Game #1, Batman: Arkham Knight #1-12, Batman: Arkham Knight Annual #1, Batman: Arkham Knight: Batgirl & Harley Quinn #1, Batman: Arkham Knight Genesis #1-6, Batman: Arkham Knight: Robin Special #1, Batman: Arkham Origins and Batman: Arkham Unhinged. Consulte a ordem de Arkham Knight para a experiência completa, incluindo quadrinhos e jogos.",
  "DCeased Omnibus new Collects DCeased #1-6; DCeased: A Good Day to Die #1; DCeased: Dead Planet #1-7; DCeased: Unkillables #1-3; DCeased: Hope At World’s End #1-15; DCeased: War of the Undead Gods #1-8.": "DCeased Omnibus — Reúne DCeased #1-6; DCeased: A Good Day to Die #1; DCeased: Dead Planet #1-7; DCeased: Unkillables #1-3; DCeased: Hope At World’s End #1-15; DCeased: War of the Undead Gods #1-8.",
  "Nightwing (vol. 2) #19-20 ties into Batman: Cataclysm, a crossover story that will lead us to No Man’s Land.": "Nightwing (vol. 2) #19-20 se conectam a Batman: Cataclysm, crossover que prepara No Man’s Land.",
  "The Nightwing issues were previously collected in: Nightwing Vol. 1: Blüdhaven (Nightwing Vol. 1 #1-4; Nightwing Vol. 2 #1-8) [2025 edition] Nightwing Vol. 2: Rough Justice (Nightwing Vol. 2 #9-18, Nightwing Annual #1) Nightwing Vol. 3: False Starts (Nightwing/Huntress #1-4; Nightwing Vol. 2 #1/2, #19-25)": "As edições de Nightwing foram anteriormente reunidas em: Nightwing Vol. 1: Blüdhaven (Nightwing Vol. 1 #1-4; Nightwing Vol. 2 #1-8) [edição de 2025] Nightwing Vol. 2: Rough Justice (Nightwing Vol. 2 #9-18, Nightwing Annual #1) Nightwing Vol. 3: False Starts (Nightwing/Huntress #1-4; Nightwing Vol. 2 #1/2, #19-25)",
  "Nightwing (vol. 2) #35-39 are part of Batman: No Man’s Land": "Nightwing (vol. 2) #35-39 fazem parte de Batman: No Man’s Land.",
